+## Workbench .29 diagnostic run ownership
+
+Queued native diagnostic refreshes retire prior fast/slow work without discarding unchanged parsed source. Save fanout observes the same per-document run boundary; repeated pull requests preserve pending current work.
+
 ## Workbench .28 route completion identity
 
 Route-name and URI-parameter completion resolve global/helper/facade aliases, namespace-local homonyms and framework receiver types. Named route values use their PHP parameter roles; unsaved helper presence changes apply without caller edits.
